@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Eliminar Aula (CLI HTTP)

actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "CLI (Click)" as CLI
participant "APIClient" as Client
participant "API (FastAPI)" as API
participant "AulaService" as Service
participant "AulaRepository" as Repo
database "Base de Datos" as DB

Admin -> CLI: Ejecuta 'sighor aulas delete 5'
activate CLI
CLI -> Admin: Prompt: Confirmar eliminación de aula 5? (y/n)
Admin -> CLI: Confirma (y)
CLI -> Client: delete('/aulas/5')
activate Client
Client -> API: DELETE /aulas/5 (Bearer Token)
activate API
API -> Service: eliminar_aula(5)
activate Service
Service -> Repo: delete(5)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: DELETE FROM aulas WHERE id = 5
activate DB
alt Eliminación exitosa
    DB --> Repo: Rows affected: 1
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: True
    deactivate Repo
    Service --> API: True
    deactivate Service
    API --> Client: 204 No Content
    deactivate API
    Client --> CLI: Response(204)
    deactivate Client
    CLI --> Admin: Aula eliminada exitosamente
else Aula no existe
    DB --> Repo: Rows affected: 0
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: False
    deactivate Repo
    Service --> API: 404 Not Found
    deactivate Service
    API --> Client: 404 Not Found
    deactivate API
    Client --> CLI: Response(404)
    deactivate Client
    CLI --> Admin: Error: Aula no encontrada
end
deactivate CLI

note right of API
  **Backend FastAPI reutilizado:**
  - AulaService
  - AulaRepository
  - Manejo de integridad referencial
  Sin modificaciones
end note

@enduml
